ez-Ramírez, W. Liao, G. Fabbro, M. Mancusi, and Y. Mitsufuji (2025)\n1020\t\n1021\tITO-master: inference-time optimization for audio effects modeling of music mastering processors.\n1022\t\n1023\tIn Proc. International Society for Music Information Retrieval (ISMIR),\n1024\t\n1025\tCited by: §I,\n1026\t§II-B.\n1027\t\n1028\t[22]\n1029\tR. Kumar, P. Seetharaman, A. Luebs, I. Kumar, and K. Kumar (2023)\n1030\t\n1031\tHigh-fidelity audio compression with improved rvqgan.\n1032\t\n1033\tIn Proc. NeurIPS,\n1034\t\n1035\tCited by: §III-B,\n1036\t§IV-D.\n1037\t\n1038\t[23]\n1039\tC. H. Lee, J. Nistal, S. Lattner, M. Pasini, and G. Fazekas (2026)\n1040\t\n1041\tDiffusion timbre transfer via mutual information guided inpainting.\n1042\t\n1043\tIn Proc. International Conference on Acoustics, Speech, and Signal Processing (ICASSP),\n1044\t\n1045\tCited by: §II-D.\n1046\t\n1047\t[24]\n1048\tS. Lee, W. Ping, B. Ginsburg, B. Catanzaro, and S. Yoon (2022)\n1049\t\n1050\tBigvgan: a universal neural vocoder with large-scale training.\n1051\t\n1052\tIn Proc. International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR),\n1053\t\n1054\tCited by: §IV-C.\n1055\t\n1056\t[25]\n1057\tY. Lee, Y. Peng, J. Wu, M. Cheng, L. Su, and Y. Yang (2024)\n1058\t\n1059\tDistortion recovery: a two-stage method for guitar effect removal.\n1060\t\n1061\tIn Proc. International Conference on Digital Audio Effects (DAFx),\n1062\t\n1063\tCited by: §I,\n1064\t§I,\n1065\t§II-C,\n1066\t§IV-C,\n1067\t§IV-C,\n1068\tTABLE II.\n1069\t\n1070\t[26]\n1071\tY. Li and S. Mandt (2018)\n1072\t\n1073\tDisentangled sequential autoencoder.\n1074\t\n1075\tIn Proc. ICML,\n1076\t\n1077\tCited by: §II-E.\n1078\t\n1079\t[27]\n1080\tJ. Liu, T. Hsu, Y. Yeh, L. Su, and Y. Yang (2026)\n1081\t\n1082\tSynthcloner: synthesizer-style audio transfer via factorized codec with adsr envelope control.\n1083\t\n1084\tIn Proc. International Conference on Acoustics, Speech, and Signal Processing (ICASSP),\n1085\t\n1086\tCited by: §III-E.\n1087\t\n1